<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 15:20:37 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>FlyDubai 副驾驶使用驾驶舱的防撞斧试图夺取飞行控制权，但由于担心极端主义观点而被阿曼禁止飞行</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/flydubai-copilot-cockpit-crash-axe-israel-flight-oman-extremist-views/</link><description>副驾驶已被确认为哈马姆·哈马米 (Hamam al-Hammami)。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2297340387-e1791039203813.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 15:02:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/flydubai-copilot-cockpit-crash-axe-israel-flight-oman-extremist-views/</guid></item><item><title>多莉·帕顿 (Dolly Parton) 的图书计划覆盖了七分之一的美国 5 岁以下儿童。还要持续多久？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/dolly-parton-books-for-kids-imagination-library/</link><description>至少有四个州出现了资金挑战，帕顿基金会现在负责该计划。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-925002586.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 15:00:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/dolly-parton-books-for-kids-imagination-library/</guid></item><item><title>麦肯锡：人工智能创造的就业机会将多于它杀死的就业机会——在消灭了 1100 万人之后</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/ai-job-displacement-creation-new-careers-11-million-americans-workforce-mobility/</link><description>只有七分之一的失业工人可以直接获得不断增长的工作，而医疗保健和建筑领域的大多数新工作都无法远程完成。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-50379000.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/ai-job-displacement-creation-new-careers-11-million-americans-workforce-mobility/</guid></item><item><title>认识一下空中交通管制员，他通过动力滑翔伞飞行上班，必须打电话给控制塔让同事知道他来了</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/air-traffic-controller-commute-powered-paragliding-control-tower/</link><description>“我很小，不会出现在雷达上，”赫兹勒说，“所以他们会想要跟踪我的位置并获取我的最新进展。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26275744020994-e1791038576220.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 14:47:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/air-traffic-controller-commute-powered-paragliding-control-tower/</guid></item><item><title>私人资本正在改变体育运动，挑战新闻界提升金融取证的技能</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/private-equity-sports-teams-journalism-oversight/</link><description>ESPN 拥有 NFL 网络，红袜队老板控制着波士顿环球报。快船队的案件被播客打破，展示了调查人员可以找到的东西。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2266504574-e1791038423274.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 14:42:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/private-equity-sports-teams-journalism-oversight/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普集会前几天，俄亥俄州工厂裁员近 1,400 人。现在，一位前支持者将帮助选举民主党人：“政治上必须做出一些改变”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/ohio-truck-factory-layoffs-trump-rally-former-supporter-democrats-midterm-elections/</link><description>此次裁员规模之大足以基本上消除俄亥俄州大代顿地区一整年的就业增长。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26275577967803-e1791037634186.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 14:37:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/ohio-truck-factory-layoffs-trump-rally-former-supporter-democrats-midterm-elections/</guid></item><item><title>海关和边境保护局去年窃听了 80,000 个 Flock 摄像头——警方并未掌握情况</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/flock-cameras-cbp-access-data-sharing/</link><description>伊利诺伊州丹维尔记录了 4,000 多次联邦搜查，尽管 ICE 没有 Flock 合同。弗洛克表示，客户控制着他们的数据。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2297053183-e1791037981109.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 14:34:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/flock-cameras-cbp-access-data-sharing/</guid></item><item><title>HOA 州：佛罗里达州可以教会美国其他地区关于公寓协会暴政下的生活</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/florida-hoa-dues-home-prices-residents/</link><description>大约 7,800 万美国人生活在 373,000 个协会之下，这些协会可以征收罚款，甚至取消抵押品赎回权。有些人被禁止投票，也无法离开。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/florida.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 14:24:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/florida-hoa-dues-home-prices-residents/</guid></item><item><title>法官暂时封锁特朗普在德克萨斯州大本德地区的边境墙，理由是可能造成“不可挽回的伤害”和“公共利益”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/judge-temporary-injunction-trump-border-wal-big-bend-region-texas-irreparable-harm-public-interest/</link><description>法院的裁决是在政府于九月中旬在大弯地区竖起第一块边界墙板几周后做出的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26273528102830-e1791036919610.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 14:23:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/judge-temporary-injunction-trump-border-wal-big-bend-region-texas-irreparable-harm-public-interest/</guid></item><item><title>GPT Oracle：十分之一的美国人正在复兴异教的预言实践</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/chatgpt-oracle-ai-opacity-user-trust/</link><description>Anthropic 报道称，Claude 4 会无缘无故地陷入神秘主题，而该公司自己的工程师并未针对这种模式进行训练或预测。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2297765991-e1791037039562.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 14:18:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/chatgpt-oracle-ai-opacity-user-trust/</guid></item></channel></rss>